n needed to support remote content updates across multiple screens and deliver vibrant visuals that match Dunkin's brand guidelines.</p><p>Brightluxx installed three seamless indoor LED display panels within the Dunkin' JLT outlet. The screens serve as dynamic digital menu boards behind the counter, showcasing menu items, pricing, combo deals, and seasonal promotions in crisp high resolution. A cloud-based CMS allows the franchise team to update content remotely, schedule time-based promotions (breakfast/lunch menus), and push new items instantly across all screens.</p><p>Location: Jumeirah Lake Towers (JLT), Dubai, UAE</p>\"}}]\nf:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\nc:null\n11:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Dunkin' Donuts JLT LED Menu Boards | Digital Signage Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"LED digital menu board installation for Dunkin' Donuts at JLT, Dubai. Three-screen indoor LED display with cloud CMS for dynamic menu and promotional content.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/case-studies/dunkin-jlt-led-menu-display\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n5:X\na:X\na:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"jmQf9k4vnRujh_agAewWg\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Article\\\", \\\"headline\\\": \\\"Dunkin' Donuts JLT - Indoor LED Menu Boards & Branding Display\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Dunkin' Donuts at JLT required a modern, energy-efficient digital menu board system to replace outdated backlit print menus. The solution needed to support remote content updates across multip