 the franchise team to update content remotely, schedule time-based promotions (breakfast/lunch menus), and push new items instantly across all screens.</p><p>Location: Jumeirah Lake Towers (JLT), Dubai, UAE</p>\"}}]\n3:[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$10\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@11\"}]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L12\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L13\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$10\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Dunkin' Donuts JLT LED Menu Boards | Digital Signage Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"LED digital menu board installation for Dunkin' Donuts at JLT, Dubai. Three-screen indoor LED display with cloud CMS for dynamic menu and promotional content.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/case-studies/dunkin-jlt-led-menu-display\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L14\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{}]}]]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/1yexyjxngf5x1.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\",\"async\":true}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L14\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{}],\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"not-found\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"children\":\"404 — Page Not Found\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Th